sequenceDiagram
  participant P0 as Client
  participant P1 as Resolver
  participant P2 as Proxy
  participant P3 as Application
  participant P4 as Database
  P0->>P1: Resolve service name
  P1->>P0: Address with cache policy
  P0->>P2: Connect and negotiate TLS
  P0->>P2: HTTP request
  P2->>P3: Forward with deadline
  P3->>P4: Authorized query
  P4->>P3: Rows
  P3->>P2: Response
  P2->>P0: HTTP result
